flowchart TD
 A[City GIS: 12 layers + checked PXO list] --> C[Check counts, IDs, timestamps and city boundary]
 B[OSM snapshot: objects, versions, tags and geometry] --> C
 C --> D[Local comparison: tags, topology, distance and speed]
 D --> E[windsor-review.geojson + CSV + summary.json]
 E --> F[Survey, permitted imagery and dated operator evidence]
 F --> G{Exact feature and proposed change verified?}
 G -->|No or uncertain| H[Keep pending; collect more evidence]
 H --> F
 G -->|Yes, suitable sources and process| I[Current OSM check; prepare .osm/.osc + export audit]
 I --> J[JOSM: current context, topology, Validator, upload]
 J --> K[Record confirmed changeset URL]
 K --> L[Next run: compare candidate queue with previous run]
 L --> D
